=== rx-rx-i-conditional
from: DOM::Tiny 0.5.2 lib/DOM/Tiny/CSS.pm6:97
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: regex adverb :i
--- code
for False, True -> $i {
    my $unescaped = 'Foo';
    my $unescaped-re = $i ?? rx:i{ $unescaped } !! rx{ $unescaped };
    my $word-re = rx{ [ ^ | \s+ ] $unescaped-re [ \s+ | $ ] };
    say $i, ': ', <foo Foo>.map({ "a $_ b" ~~ $word-re ?? 'y' !! 'n' }).join;
}
--- expect
False: ny
True: yy

=== rx-m-g-pairs-radix
