=== rx-match-i-adverb-arg
from: File::Which 1.0.4 lib/File/Which/Win32.rakumod:38
license: MIT
feature: method match
ruled: Raku++ applies a :i passed to .match(Regex); Rakudo 2026.09 ignores the adverb there
--- code
my @PATHEXT = '', '.EXE', '.BAT', '.CMD';
for <setup.exe run.Bat notes.txt> -> $file {
    say $file, ': ', so @PATHEXT[1..@PATHEXT.elems - 1].grep({ $file.match(/ $_ $ /, :i) });
}
--- expect
setup.exe: True
run.Bat: True
notes.txt: False

