=== rx-subst-global-named-arg
from: DBIish 0.6.9 lib/DBDish/Connection.rakumod:193
license: BSD-2-Clause
feature: method subst
--- code
sub quote-identifier(Str $x) {
    q["] ~ $x.subst(q{"}, q{""}, :global) ~ q["]
}
say quote-identifier('plain');
say quote-identifier('we"ird"name');
--- expect
"plain"
"we""ird""name"

